e unit points wisely and build the best combos for your playstyle.<br><br></li><li>New characters every month!</li></ul></i> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1850490/extras/ac8d48f348f06dc7ee7200a62c9c5312.poster.avif?t=1749037318\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1850490/extras/ac8d48f348f06dc7ee7200a62c9c5312.webm?t=1749037318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1850490/extras/ac8d48f348f06dc7ee7200a62c9c5312.mp4?t=1749037318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Must Play for Strategical War Fans.</strong></h2> <br><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the Lore-rich world of the Cosmic Realm and Armnivarde!<br><br></li><li>Endless creation, and uninterrupted fun for all ages, Warmonium is an experience for all to enjoy!  <br><br></li><li> Ranked mode and Tournaments coming soon!</li></ul></i>",
